{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>炎明熹近日為宣傳全新音樂作品化身瀟灑失戀女，於海濱一帶拍攝短片大爆愛情金句。她在鏡頭前突然戲癮大發，手持道具當街上演一幕霸氣撕毁婚書戲碼。這位樂壇小天后罕見展現出決絕狠心反差面貌，這次破格聯乘企劃為即將發佈新歌埋下極大伏線。</p>\n<h2>炎明熹型格打扮 大爆失戀金句</h2>\n<p>這名新生代女歌手一改平日在公眾面前乖巧伶俐形象，換上型格黑色波點透視長袖上衣及闊身牛仔短褲，手持迷你咪高峰現身海濱拍攝預告片。她在鏡頭前完全放飛自我，擺出極度瀟灑神情大叫「好似韓劇咁！鬼！狂！」，甚至肉緊握拳高呼「決心要放低前度！」。全片最具衝擊力一幕正是她拿出手寫結婚紙道具，對鏡頭一臉認真丟下一句「好彩仲未去簽紙」，隨即毫不猶豫雙手齊上將紙張狠狠撕成兩半。</p>\n<h2>炎明熹夥拍「前小薯茄GenZ實習生」自嘲感情上撞板</h2>\n<p>除了獨自飆戲展現過人演藝細胞，預告片段中更出現另一張網民熟悉面孔，正是「前小薯茄GenZ實習生」李倩同。身穿深藍色針織外套配搭淺藍恤衫現身客串，與一身酷爆造型女主角並肩站在海旁樹蔭下合體大拋笑彈。兩人頭貼頭拿著迷你咪高峰默契十足望向鏡頭，齊齊大聲宣告「感情路上撞咗板！」，以中二幽默手法演繹新世代面對感情挫折灑脫態度。</p>\n<h2>炎明熹李倩同青春滿瀉充滿火花</h2>\n<p>這次宣傳企劃巧妙融合流行音樂與網絡短片元素帶來新鮮感。在另一幕充滿幕後花絮感畫面之中，樂壇小天后開心對著鏡頭舉起V字手勢，身旁拍檔則面帶甜美微笑伸手介紹，整個同框畫面洋溢著滿滿青春活力。兩名不同頻道具潛力新生代女生首次跨界合作充滿火花，雙雙以截然不同活潑形象呈現人前。</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17949089685368865_10394704636afc232925cf1.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"炎明熹 李倩同 （圖片來源：IG@yiminghay）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17949089685368865_10394704636afc232925cf1.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@yiminghay）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179490896979437041_15089030866afc232a3e180.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"炎明熹 李倩同 （圖片來源：IG@yiminghay）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179490896979437041_15089030866afc232a3e180.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@yiminghay）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179490897067521108_19685252016afc232b10cfa.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"炎明熹 李倩同 （圖片來源：IG@yiminghay）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179490897067521108_19685252016afc232b10cfa.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@yiminghay）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179490897144156582_14282709506afc232be1dd6.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"炎明熹 李倩同 （圖片來源：IG@yiminghay）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179490897144156582_14282709506afc232be1dd6.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@yiminghay）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179490897237361377_13151127156afc232cc988b.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"炎明熹 李倩同 （圖片來源：IG@yiminghay）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179490897237361377_13151127156afc232cc988b.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@yiminghay）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/photo_6262396509429551375_y_85783167468e1fcea76981.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"炎明熹 李倩同 「前小薯茄GenZ實習生」李倩同（圖片來源：YouTube@小薯茄）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/photo_6262396509429551375_y_85783167468e1fcea76981.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>「前小薯茄GenZ實習生」李倩同（圖片來源：YouTube@小薯茄）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/175963978806346103_24946791768e1f8ec72b5d.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"炎明熹 李倩同 （圖片來源：IG@ana.belle.li）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/175963978806346103_24946791768e1f8ec72b5d.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@ana.belle.li）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/fyioral-_99096116568e1fc4d23e54-1024x1279.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"炎明熹 李倩同 （圖片來源：IG@ana.belle.li）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/fyioral-_99096116568e1fc4d23e54-1024x1279.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@ana.belle.li）</figcaption></figure>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？<i></i></p>\n<p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/hong-kong-concerts-2025-2402813/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">香港演唱會2025一覽</a></b>，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p>\n<p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1217277/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1217277\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">親子好去處</a></b>、拍拖推介32大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1312748/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1312748\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情侶好去處</a></b>、落雨必去的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1128512/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1128512\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>、慶生推薦20大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1363483/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1363483\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-21T13:23:57.053395+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":1039,"images":8,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-21T13:00:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-21T13:17:26.705305+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-21T13:17:26.705305+00:00","content_hash":"05bb92ecc6a69a0df20942d5bc8d3068cf3aac34c1c39340718b209e5c50d9d8","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}